{"seq":3,"slug":"modern-coupling-reactions","title":"现代偶联反应（Modern Coupling Reactions）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/modern-coupling-reactions","wordCount":3373,"readingTime":14,"html":"<h1 id=\"现代偶联反应-modern-coupling-reactions\">现代偶联反应（Modern Coupling Reactions）</h1><h2 id=\"引言\">引言</h2><p>2010 年 10 月 6 日，瑞典皇家科学院宣布将诺贝尔化学奖授予美国化学家 Richard F. Heck（特拉华大学）、日本化学家根岸英一（Negishi Ei-ichi，普渡大学）和铃木章（Suzuki Akira，北海道大学），表彰他们在&quot;有机合成中的钯催化交叉偶联反应&quot;领域的贡献。这一奖项标志着过渡金属催化 C—C 键形成反应正式登上有机化学的巅峰殿堂。</p>\n<p>交叉偶联反应（Cross-Coupling Reaction）的核心思想是：在钯（或镍）催化剂的作用下，将一个有机亲电体（通常为卤代烃 R—X）与一个有机亲核体（有机金属试剂 R&#39;—M）连接起来，形成新的 C—C 键：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>R’—M</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>R—R’</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>M—X</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—X} + \\text{R&#x27;—M} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0)} \\text{R—R&#x27;} + \\text{M—X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’—M</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—R’</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M—X</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这些反应在药物合成、材料科学、农业化学和精细化工中的应用已经无处不在——据估计，全球工业化学过程中约 25% 涉及某种形式的偶联反应。</p>\n<h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p><strong>交叉偶联的统一思想是&quot;让两个碳片段在金属的协调下连接&quot;</strong>。钯（或镍）催化剂像一个&quot;可编程的连接器&quot;：先后把两个不同的有机基团抓到同一个金属中心上，再让它们偶联离去，自己回到起始状态继续循环。这一循环把&quot;两个本来不肯反应的片段&quot;变成&quot;可以按需连接的模块&quot;。</p>\n<p>拆解这套化学，只需抓住一个循环和三个变量：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>三步催化循环</strong>：氧化加成（Pd(0)→Pd(II)，插入 C—X）→ 转金属化（有机金属试剂把 R&#39; 交给钯）→ 还原消除（R—R&#39; 偶联离去，Pd(II)→Pd(0)）。三步的顺序和能垒决定了反应的速率与选择性。</li>\n<li><strong>三个变量定义各类反应</strong>：转金属化步骤使用的<strong>有机金属试剂</strong>区分了 Suzuki（硼）、Negishi（锌）、Stille（锡）、Kumada（镁）；Heck 则特殊，不经转金属化，而是经碳钯化/β-氢消除，让普通烯烃当&quot;亲核伙伴&quot;；Sonogashira 用末端炔烃，索性省去预制的有机金属试剂。</li>\n<li><strong>配体是调参旋钮</strong>：配体的电子密度调控氧化加成（富电子配体让 Pd(0) 更亲核），位阻调控还原消除（大位阻迫使两个基团靠近偶联），手性配体则实现不对称偶联。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>判读与选用的实用逻辑</strong>：底物越&quot;惰性&quot;（如 ArCl）越需要富电子、大位阻配体（P(t-Bu)₃、Buchwald 家族）；对官能团兼容性要求高时优先 Suzuki（硼试剂温和、无毒）；需要 sp³ 碳或高选择性时考虑 Negishi；构建 C—N 键则用 Buchwald-Hartwig 胺化。</p>\n<p><strong>常见误解</strong>：认为&quot;偶联反应就是 Suzuki&quot;，或把 Heck 与其它偶联混为一谈。Heck 的反应伙伴是烯烃而非有机金属试剂，机理中根本没有转金属化步骤；把它与 Suzuki 画等号会直接导致区域选择性判断错误。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;  CYC[&quot;Pd(0) 催化循环&quot;] --&gt; OA[&quot;1. 氧化加成: Pd(0)+R-X → R-Pd(II)-X&quot;]&#10;  OA --&gt; TM[&quot;2. 转金属化: R&#39;-M 交出 R&#39;&quot;]&#10;  TM --&gt; RE[&quot;3. 还原消除: R-R&#39; 离去, Pd(II)→Pd(0)&quot;]&#10;  RE --&gt; CYC&#10;  TM --&gt; T1[&quot;Suzuki: R&#39;-B (硼)&quot;]&#10;  TM --&gt; T2[&quot;Negishi: R&#39;-Zn (锌)&quot;]&#10;  TM --&gt; T3[&quot;Stille: R&#39;-Sn (锡)&quot;]&#10;  TM --&gt; T4[&quot;Kumada: R&#39;-Mg (镁)&quot;]&#10;  CYC --&gt; HECK[&quot;Heck: 烯烃伙伴, 无转金属化&quot;]&#10;  CYC --&gt; SONO[&quot;Sonogashira: 末端炔, Pd/Cu 双催化&quot;]&#10;  RE --&gt; LIG[&quot;配体调控: 电子密度/位阻/手性&quot;]\">graph TD\n  CYC[\"Pd(0) 催化循环\"] --&gt; OA[\"1. 氧化加成: Pd(0)+R-X → R-Pd(II)-X\"]\n  OA --&gt; TM[\"2. 转金属化: R'-M 交出 R'\"]\n  TM --&gt; RE[\"3. 还原消除: R-R' 离去, Pd(II)→Pd(0)\"]\n  RE --&gt; CYC\n  TM --&gt; T1[\"Suzuki: R'-B (硼)\"]\n  TM --&gt; T2[\"Negishi: R'-Zn (锌)\"]\n  TM --&gt; T3[\"Stille: R'-Sn (锡)\"]\n  TM --&gt; T4[\"Kumada: R'-Mg (镁)\"]\n  CYC --&gt; HECK[\"Heck: 烯烃伙伴, 无转金属化\"]\n  CYC --&gt; SONO[\"Sonogashira: 末端炔, Pd/Cu 双催化\"]\n  RE --&gt; LIG[\"配体调控: 电子密度/位阻/手性\"]</pre><h2 id=\"钯催化的基本机理\">钯催化的基本机理</h2><h3 id=\"催化循环\">催化循环</h3><p>所有钯催化交叉偶联共享一个基本催化循环，包含三个关键步骤：</p>\n<p><strong>步骤 1：氧化加成（Oxidative Addition）</strong></p>\n<p>零价钯 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Pd}(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span> 插入有机卤化物 R—X 的 C—X 键中，氧化态从 0 升至 +2：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo>+</mo><mtext>R—X</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>R—Pd(II)—X</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Pd}(0) + \\text{R—X} \\rightarrow \\text{R—Pd(II)—X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—Pd(II)—X</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>反应活性：R—I &gt; R—Br &gt; R—Cl &gt; R—F（与 C—X 键能成反比）。芳基卤和乙烯基卤比烷基卤更容易发生氧化加成（sp² C—X 键更容易插入）。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤 2：转金属化（Transmetalation）</strong></p>\n<p>有机金属试剂 R&#39;—M 将其有机基团 R&#39; 转移到钯上，M 同时带走 X：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—Pd(II)—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>R’—M</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>R—Pd(II)—R’</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>M—X</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—Pd(II)—X} + \\text{R&#x27;—M} \\rightarrow \\text{R—Pd(II)—R&#x27;} + \\text{M—X}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—Pd(II)—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’—M</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—Pd(II)—R’</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">M—X</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一步是区分不同偶联反应类型的关键——Suzuki 反应用有机硼（R&#39;—B），Negishi 用有机锌（R&#39;—Zn），Stille 用有机锡（R&#39;—Sn），Kumada 用 Grignard 试剂（R&#39;—Mg）。</p>\n<p><strong>步骤 3：还原消除（Reductive Elimination）</strong></p>\n<p>R 和 R&#39; 从钯上偶联离去，形成产物 R—R&#39;，钯回到零价重新进入催化循环：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—Pd(II)—R’</mtext><mo>→</mo><mtext>R—R’</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—Pd(II)—R&#x27;} \\rightarrow \\text{R—R&#x27;} + \\text{Pd}(0)</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—Pd(II)—R’</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel\">→</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7778em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—R’</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1em;vertical-align:-0.25em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen\">(</span><span class=\"mord\">0</span><span class=\"mclose\">)</span></span></span></span></span></div><p>还原消除保持产物碳原子的构型——这赋予偶联反应优异的立体选择性。</p>\n<h3 id=\"配体的作用\">配体的作用</h3><p>钯催化剂通常不以裸露的 Pd(0) 使用，而是配位有机膦配体（Phosphine Ligands）形成络合物。配体的作用：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>稳定 Pd(0)</strong>：防止钯聚集为不活泼的钯黑</li>\n<li><strong>调控电子密度</strong>：富电子配体促进氧化加成（使 Pd(0) 更亲核）</li>\n<li><strong>控制位阻</strong>：大体积配体加速还原消除（因空间拥挤迫使 R 和 R&#39; 靠近偶联）</li>\n<li><strong>提高选择性</strong>：手性配体实现不对称偶联</li>\n</ol>\n<p>经典配体演进：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>PPh₃（三苯基膦，第一代，通用但活性有限）</li>\n<li>P(t-Bu)₃（三叔丁基膦，1998 Fu 开发，活化 ArCl）</li>\n<li>SPhos, XPhos, RuPhos（Buchwald 配体家族，2000 年代，极高活性）</li>\n<li>BINAP（手性配体，用于不对称反应）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"主要的偶联反应类型\">主要的偶联反应类型</h2><p>下面对比几种主流偶联反应的核心差异——有机金属伙伴、机理特点、优势与主要局限：</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>反应</th>\n<th>有机金属/伙伴</th>\n<th>首报</th>\n<th>核心优势</th>\n<th>主要局限</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>Suzuki</td>\n<td>芳基硼酸 R—B(OH)₂</td>\n<td>1979</td>\n<td>硼试剂稳定无毒、耐水耐空气、官能团兼容性最好、品种最丰富</td>\n<td>需碱活化硼酸；部分硼酸自偶联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Heck</td>\n<td>烯烃（无金属伙伴）</td>\n<td>1972</td>\n<td>直接以烯烃为伙伴，无需有机金属试剂</td>\n<td>仅限 sp² 芳基/乙烯基卤；需高温</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Negishi</td>\n<td>有机锌 R—ZnCl</td>\n<td>1977</td>\n<td>选择性与官能团兼容性极好，可做 sp³ 碳</td>\n<td>锌试剂对水氧敏感，需现制</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Stille</td>\n<td>有机锡 R—SnR₃</td>\n<td>1978</td>\n<td>锡试剂极稳定、兼容性广</td>\n<td>有机锡有毒，工业受限</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Sonogashira</td>\n<td>末端炔烃 + CuI</td>\n<td>1975</td>\n<td>免预制金属试剂，直接构建 C≡C</td>\n<td>Pd/Cu 双催化，Cu 可能引发炔自偶联</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Buchwald-Hartwig</td>\n<td>胺 R₂NH（构建 C—N）</td>\n<td>1990s</td>\n<td>芳基胺合成高效通用</td>\n<td>需专门配体与强碱</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h3 id=\"suzuki-偶联-铃木反应-1979\">Suzuki 偶联（铃木反应，1979）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ar—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>Ar’—B(OH)</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Base</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Ar—Ar’</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—X} + \\text{Ar&#x27;—B(OH)}_2 \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0), \\text{Base}} \\text{Ar—Ar&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.4467em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar’—B(OH)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.1514em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Base</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—Ar’</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有机金属试剂：芳基硼酸 Ar—B(OH)₂ 或硼酸酯 Ar—B(pin)</li>\n<li>优势：硼试剂稳定、无毒、对空气和水不敏感、容易制备</li>\n<li>碱的作用：活化硼酸（形成 <span class=\"math-inline\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><semantics><mrow><msubsup><mtext>Ar—B(OH)</mtext><mn>3</mn><mo>−</mo></msubsup></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—B(OH)}_3^-</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.2109em;vertical-align:-0.2997em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—B(OH)</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.9112em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.4003em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span><span style=\"top:-3.2029em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mbin mtight\">−</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.2997em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span>）使转金属化得以进行</li>\n<li>条件典型：Pd(PPh₃)₄ 或 Pd(dppf)Cl₂, K₂CO₃, THF/H₂O, 80°C</li>\n<li>底物范围：芳基、乙烯基、杂环卤化物与硼酸偶联</li>\n</ul>\n<p>Suzuki 反应是目前工业和学术界使用<strong>最广泛</strong>的偶联反应。原因：硼试剂商业品种丰富（数千种可直接购买）、反应条件温和、官能团兼容性好、无重金属副产物。</p>\n<h3 id=\"heck-反应-赫克反应-1972\">Heck 反应（赫克反应，1972）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ar—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>CH</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>=CHR</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Base</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Ar—CH=CHR</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—X} + \\text{CH}_2\\text{=CHR} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0), \\text{Base}} \\text{Ar—CH=CHR}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.297em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">CH</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">=CHR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Base</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—CH=CHR</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>Heck 反应与其他偶联反应的根本不同：亲核性伙伴不是有机金属试剂，而是普通的烯烃。机理也不同——没有转金属化步骤，取而代之的是：</p>\n<ol>\n<li>氧化加成：Pd(0) + ArX → Ar—Pd—X</li>\n<li><strong>碳钯化</strong>（Carbopalladation）：Ar—Pd—X 中的 Ar 插入 C=C 键</li>\n<li><strong>β-氢消除</strong>（β-Hydride Elimination）：Pd—H 从产物碳上消除，形成新的 C=C 键</li>\n<li>碱夺取 HX 再生 Pd(0)</li>\n</ol>\n<p>区域选择性：Ar 优先加在双键取代程度低的碳上（类似 anti-Markovnikov）。</p>\n<p>应用：合成肉桂酸衍生物（Ar—CH=CH—COOH）、芪类化合物、共轭高分子（如 MEH-PPV 有机发光材料）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"negishi-偶联-根岸反应-1977\">Negishi 偶联（根岸反应，1977）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>R’—ZnX</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>R—R’</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—X} + \\text{R&#x27;—ZnX} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0)} \\text{R—R&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’—ZnX</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—R’</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有机金属试剂：有机锌化合物 R—ZnCl</li>\n<li>优势：官能团兼容性极好（锌试剂温和），反应选择性高</li>\n<li>适用于 sp³ 碳的偶联（其他方法困难的领域）</li>\n<li>常用于复杂天然产物全合成中的关键 C—C 键构建</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"stille-偶联-1978\">Stille 偶联（1978）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>R—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>R’—SnR</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>R—R’</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—X} + \\text{R&#x27;—SnR}_3 \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0)} \\text{R—R&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.297em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’—SnR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—R’</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>特点：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>有机锡试剂稳定性极好，对各种官能团兼容</li>\n<li>局限：有机锡化合物有毒性（限制工业应用）</li>\n<li>仍在学术研究（尤其天然产物全合成）中广泛使用</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"sonogashira-偶联-1975\">Sonogashira 偶联（1975）</h3><div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ar—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>HC≡CR</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>CuI, amine</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><mtext>Ar—C≡C—R</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—X} + \\text{HC≡CR} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0), \\text{CuI, amine}} \\text{Ar—C≡C—R}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">HC≡CR</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">CuI, amine</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—C≡C—R</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>特点：Pd/Cu 双金属催化，无需预制有机金属试剂（直接用末端炔烃）。适合构建共轭炔烃——在有机电子材料和药物中间体合成中应用广泛。</p>\n<h2 id=\"buchwald-hartwig-胺化反应\">Buchwald-Hartwig 胺化反应</h2><p>超越 C—C 键形成，钯催化还能实现 C—N 键的构建：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ar—X</mtext><mo>+</mo><msub><mtext>R</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub><mtext>NH</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mrow><mtext>Pd</mtext><mo stretchy=\"false\">(</mo><mn>0</mn><mo stretchy=\"false\">)</mo><mo separator=\"true\">,</mo><mtext>Ligand, Base</mtext></mrow></mpadded></mover><msub><mtext>Ar—NR</mtext><mn>2</mn></msub></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—X} + \\text{R}_2\\text{NH} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd}(0), \\text{Ligand, Base}} \\text{Ar—NR}_2</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.297em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">NH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd</span></span><span class=\"mopen mtight\">(</span><span class=\"mord mtight\">0</span><span class=\"mclose mtight\">)</span><span class=\"mpunct mtight\">,</span><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Ligand, Base</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—NR</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">2</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>由 Stephen Buchwald（MIT）和 John Hartwig（加州大学伯克利）在 1990 年代独立发展。该反应使芳基胺的合成变得高效且通用，对药物合成影响巨大——约 40% 的药物分子含有芳基胺键。</p>\n<h2 id=\"新一代偶联化学\">新一代偶联化学</h2><h3 id=\"镍催化偶联\">镍催化偶联</h3><p>镍比钯廉价 1000 倍以上，且具有独特的反应性（容易发生自由基单电子过程）。近年来镍催化偶联在以下方面取得突破：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>活化 C—O 键（酚酯、碳酸酯作为底物替代卤化物）</li>\n<li>sp³ 碳的偶联（利用自由基机理克服 β-H 消除问题）</li>\n<li>光氧化还原/镍双催化（2014 年 MacMillan、Molander 开创）</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"光氧化还原催化与偶联\">光氧化还原催化与偶联</h3><p>2021 年诺贝尔化学奖得主 David MacMillan 将光催化与镍催化结合——用可见光激发光催化剂产生自由基，再被镍捕获进行偶联。这一&quot;双催化&quot;策略极大拓展了可偶联底物的范围（包括通常惰性的 C—H 键）。</p>\n<h3 id=\"c-h-直接活化\">C—H 直接活化</h3><p>传统偶联需要预先在底物上安装离去基团（X）或有机金属基团（M）——这本身就需要合成步骤。C—H 活化（C—H Activation）的理想是直接利用分子中本来就存在的 C—H 键参与偶联，省去底物预功能化步骤：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><mtext>Ar—H</mtext><mo>+</mo><mtext>Ar’—X</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Pd, Oxidant</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>Ar—Ar’</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{Ar—H} + \\text{Ar&#x27;—X} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Pd, Oxidant}} \\text{Ar—Ar&#x27;}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.7667em;vertical-align:-0.0833em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—H</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.1191em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar’—X</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.1081em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Pd, Oxidant</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.6944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">Ar—Ar’</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>这一领域仍在快速发展中，关键挑战是实现位置选择性——分子中通常有多个 C—H 键，如何让催化剂只活化目标位置的那一个。导向基策略（使用可配位基团引导金属接近特定 C—H）是目前最成功的解决方案之一。</p>\n<h3 id=\"2022-年诺贝尔化学奖-点击化学\">2022 年诺贝尔化学奖：点击化学</h3><p>2022 年诺贝尔化学奖授予 Carolyn Bertozzi、Morten Meldal 和 K. Barry Sharpless，表彰他们发展的点击化学（Click Chemistry）和生物正交化学。其中最核心的反应——铜催化叠氮-炔环加成（CuAAC）：</p>\n<div class=\"math-block\"><span class=\"katex-display\"><span class=\"katex\"><span class=\"katex-mathml\"><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\" display=\"block\"><semantics><mrow><msub><mtext>R—N</mtext><mn>3</mn></msub><mo>+</mo><mtext>R’—C≡CH</mtext><mover><mo stretchy=\"true\" minsize=\"3.0em\">→</mo><mpadded width=\"+0.6em\" lspace=\"0.3em\"><mtext>Cu(I)</mtext></mpadded></mover><mtext>1,2,3-三唑</mtext></mrow><annotation encoding=\"application/x-tex\">\\text{R—N}_3 + \\text{R&#x27;—C≡CH} \\xrightarrow{\\text{Cu(I)}} \\text{1,2,3-三唑}</annotation></semantics></math></span><span class=\"katex-html\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8333em;vertical-align:-0.15em;\"></span><span class=\"mord\"><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R—N</span></span><span class=\"msupsub\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.3011em;\"><span style=\"top:-2.55em;margin-right:0.05em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">3</span></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.15em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span><span class=\"mbin\">+</span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2222em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:1.158em;vertical-align:-0.011em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">R’—C≡CH</span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span><span class=\"mrel x-arrow\"><span class=\"vlist-t vlist-t2\"><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:1.147em;\"><span style=\"top:-3.322em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight x-arrow-pad\"><span class=\"mord mtight\"><span class=\"mord text mtight\"><span class=\"mord mtight\">Cu(I)</span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"svg-align\" style=\"top:-2.689em;\"><span class=\"pstrut\" style=\"height:2.7em;\"></span><span class=\"hide-tail\" style=\"height:0.522em;min-width:1.469em;\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"400em\" height=\"0.522em\" viewBox=\"0 0 400000 522\" preserveAspectRatio=\"xMaxYMin slice\"><path d=\"M0 241v40h399891c-47.3 35.3-84 78-110 128\n-16.7 32-27.7 63.7-33 95 0 1.3-.2 2.7-.5 4-.3 1.3-.5 2.3-.5 3 0 7.3 6.7 11 20\n 11 8 0 13.2-.8 15.5-2.5 2.3-1.7 4.2-5.5 5.5-11.5 2-13.3 5.7-27 11-41 14.7-44.7\n 39-84.5 73-119.5s73.7-60.2 119-75.5c6-2 9-5.7 9-11s-3-9-9-11c-45.3-15.3-85\n-40.5-119-75.5s-58.3-74.8-73-119.5c-4.7-14-8.3-27.3-11-40-1.3-6.7-3.2-10.8-5.5\n-12.5-2.3-1.7-7.5-2.5-15.5-2.5-14 0-21 3.7-21 11 0 2 2 10.3 6 25 20.7 83.3 67\n 151.7 139 205zm0 0v40h399900v-40z\"/></svg></span></span></span><span class=\"vlist-s\">​</span></span><span class=\"vlist-r\"><span class=\"vlist\" style=\"height:0.011em;\"><span></span></span></span></span></span><span class=\"mspace\" style=\"margin-right:0.2778em;\"></span></span><span class=\"base\"><span class=\"strut\" style=\"height:0.8778em;vertical-align:-0.1944em;\"></span><span class=\"mord text\"><span class=\"mord\">1,2,3-</span><span class=\"mord cjk_fallback\">三唑</span></span></span></span></span></span></div><p>CuAAC 的特点：高度可靠、条件温和、选择性完美、产率近定量、兼容水溶液——被 Sharpless 定义为&quot;click chemistry&quot;的原型反应。它已广泛应用于药物偶联（ADC）、生物标记、材料交联和高分子合成。</p>\n<h2 id=\"偶联反应在工业中的应用\">偶联反应在工业中的应用</h2><h3 id=\"药物合成\">药物合成</h3><p>偶联反应在现代制药工业中不可或缺。FDA 批准的小分子药物中，约 40% 的合成路线涉及至少一步偶联反应。典型案例：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>洛沙坦（Losartan，降压药）</strong>：关键步骤为 Suzuki 偶联构建联苯结构</li>\n<li><strong>伊马替尼（Imatinib，抗白血病药）</strong>：Buchwald-Hartwig 胺化构建 Ar—N 键</li>\n<li><strong>阿比特龙（Abiraterone，抗前列腺癌）</strong>：Suzuki 偶联连接吡啶与甾体骨架</li>\n<li><strong>瑞德西韦（Remdesivir，抗病毒药）</strong>：Sonogashira 偶联构建核苷修饰</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"有机电子材料\">有机电子材料</h3><p>共轭聚合物（有机太阳能电池、OLED 材料）的合成高度依赖偶联反应：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Suzuki 聚缩合（Suzuki Polycondensation）：制备聚芴、聚噻吩衍生物</li>\n<li>Stille 聚缩合：制备 donor-acceptor 共聚物</li>\n<li>Heck 反应：制备 PPV（聚对苯乙烯）类发光聚合物</li>\n</ul>\n<h3 id=\"农业化学品\">农业化学品</h3><p>除草剂、杀菌剂中大量联苯/杂环联苯结构通过 Suzuki 偶联在工业规模（数千吨/年）合成：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>嘧菌酯（Azoxystrobin，全球销量最大的杀菌剂之一）</li>\n<li>双氟磺草胺（Florasulam，除草剂）</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"本章小结\">本章小结</h2><p>现代偶联反应是 20 世纪下半叶有机化学最重要的方法学革命。从 Heck（1972）到 Suzuki/Negishi（1977-1979），再到 Buchwald-Hartwig（1994）和光催化双催化（2014），偶联反应不断拓展可构建的键的类型和底物范围。</p>\n<p>核心框架：</p>\n<ol>\n<li><strong>催化循环</strong>：氧化加成 → 转金属化 → 还原消除（Pd(0)/Pd(II) 循环）</li>\n<li><strong>Suzuki 反应</strong>：最通用（芳基硼酸 + 芳基卤），工业首选</li>\n<li><strong>Heck 反应</strong>：唯一不需有机金属试剂的偶联（直接用烯烃）</li>\n<li><strong>Negishi 反应</strong>：最高选择性，适合全合成</li>\n<li><strong>新方向</strong>：镍催化、光催化、C—H 活化——追求&quot;更便宜、更绿色、更少预功能化&quot;</li>\n<li><strong>工业价值</strong>：药物、材料、农化品合成中的核心技术</li>\n</ol>\n<p>交叉偶联反应的发展历程启示我们：一个基础科学发现（钯催化 C—C 键形成）从实验室走向工业应用需要数十年的持续优化，但一旦成熟就会对整个行业产生革命性影响——这正是基础研究投资的深远价值。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"现代偶联反应（Modern Coupling Reactions）","id":"现代偶联反应-modern-coupling-reactions"},{"level":2,"text":"引言","id":"引言"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"钯催化的基本机理","id":"钯催化的基本机理"},{"level":3,"text":"催化循环","id":"催化循环"},{"level":3,"text":"配体的作用","id":"配体的作用"},{"level":2,"text":"主要的偶联反应类型","id":"主要的偶联反应类型"},{"level":3,"text":"Suzuki 偶联（铃木反应，1979）","id":"suzuki-偶联-铃木反应-1979"},{"level":3,"text":"Heck 反应（赫克反应，1972）","id":"heck-反应-赫克反应-1972"},{"level":3,"text":"Negishi 偶联（根岸反应，1977）","id":"negishi-偶联-根岸反应-1977"},{"level":3,"text":"Stille 偶联（1978）","id":"stille-偶联-1978"},{"level":3,"text":"Sonogashira 偶联（1975）","id":"sonogashira-偶联-1975"},{"level":2,"text":"Buchwald-Hartwig 胺化反应","id":"buchwald-hartwig-胺化反应"},{"level":2,"text":"新一代偶联化学","id":"新一代偶联化学"},{"level":3,"text":"镍催化偶联","id":"镍催化偶联"},{"level":3,"text":"光氧化还原催化与偶联","id":"光氧化还原催化与偶联"},{"level":3,"text":"C—H 直接活化","id":"c-h-直接活化"},{"level":3,"text":"2022 年诺贝尔化学奖：点击化学","id":"2022-年诺贝尔化学奖-点击化学"},{"level":2,"text":"偶联反应在工业中的应用","id":"偶联反应在工业中的应用"},{"level":3,"text":"药物合成","id":"药物合成"},{"level":3,"text":"有机电子材料","id":"有机电子材料"},{"level":3,"text":"农业化学品","id":"农业化学品"},{"level":2,"text":"本章小结","id":"本章小结"}],"prev":{"title":"保护基策略（Protecting Group Strategy）","url":"/l-doc-books/h/chemistry/organic-chemistry/synthesis-strategy/protecting-groups"},"next":null}